        SWAP_VIA_ROUTE // 7: generic multi-hop route stored per quote token in _quoteSwapRoutePtr.
        //    Venue-agnostic (V2/V3/V4/PCS_INFINITY_CL per hop). The stored hops describe the
        //    native→quote direction (first hop's input is implicitly WETH, last hop's tokenOut
        //    is the quote token); the quote→native direction walks the same hops in reverse.
